  data: {
    LLM: "Try to maintain cards in multiple suits. Play high cards to win tricks when you have strength in a suit. When leading with the stock low, consider leading suits where opponents may be forced to pass.\n\nPay attention to which suits opponents are drawing for. If you win a trick and the stock is low, leading a suit where you saw someone drawing can force them to pass and take cards.\n\nCard counting to track which high cards remain. Strategic use of the joker if playing with one. Managing hand size - sometimes it's better to pass and take cards if you can then control play.",
